WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
You choose one of two portrait cards.
The recorded choice is A.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
In a 2005 experiment, the outcome was
sometimes secretly switched.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Now a different card appears
as the supposed original choice.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Some participants missed the switch
and could still explain the result.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
An explanation can be sincere
without establishing the cause.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Preserve the decision.
Check the record. Read the experiment.
